      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If validation checks fail during the patch, the rollback procedure is to use the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior rules and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay is notified, an incident is opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays are reverted. This rollback is automatic if any validation fails, ensuring a safe fallback to the pre-patch ruleset [art_fff67d92fe41].",
