      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight Solutions. The exact milestone is the acceptance of the remediation plan for the taxonomy change incident, specifically achieving the acceptance criteria by 2026-05-14. This includes precision@10 >= 0.8 for facility lookups, entity-link hit rate >= 90%, and grouping false positives <= 5%. The remediation plan involves verifying schema registry compatibility by 2026-03-22, building a shadow index by 2026-04-09, backfilling enrichment and recomputing index weights by 2026-04-30, and a validation window until 2026-05-14. Failure to meet these milestones risks procurement extending a tactical PoC with NoiseGuard, a cheaper competitor, which could fragment the stack and increase retention risk [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3].",
